#. module: bf_rental_rent
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_rental_rent/models/bf_rental_term.py:0
msgid ""
"Un terme ne peut pas excéder le loyer convenu de %(rent)s. Réclamer d'un "
"coup ce qui reste du bail est sans effet (art. 1905 C.c.Q.), et exiger un "
"versement supérieur à un mois de loyer est interdit (art. 1904 al. 1)."
msgstr ""
"An instalment may not exceed the agreed rent of %(rent)s. A clause making "
"the full amount of the rent payable at once is without effect (art. 1905 "
"CCQ), and exacting an instalment in excess of one month's rent is forbidden "
"(art. 1904 para. 1)."

#. module: bf_rental_rent
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_rental_rent/models/bf_rental_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"Un versement porte un montant positif. Une correction se fait en modifiant "
"le versement, pas en en créant un négatif qui ferait mentir l'historique."
msgstr ""
"A payment carries a positive amount. A correction is made by changing the "
"payment, not by creating a negative one that would make the history lie."

